* Modded-British preamp, stage 2 of 3: V2A and V2B (the BE / HBE chain). The raw input (in) and V1A's plate (p1) arrive through VLIN and VL1; the
* Gain network behind V2B (2n2, the pot, 470k) is repeated at the output as its load. See preamp.net for how the netlist is split.

.nodes x in p1 c3n v1o v2s ng2 p2 k2 n2 f2 fat s2a s2b g2c r26 r16 ng3 p3 kb gt gw ng4

V VRAIL x 471.8 430
C C28 x 0 4.664u

S VLIN in 1 0
S VL1 p1 1 0
C C3 p1 c3n 2n2
R R5 c3n v1o 1M
R R6 v1o 0 68k
R SW_RAW in v2s 1
R SW_V1 v1o v2s 1e12
R R11 v2s 0 10M
R R7 v2s ng2 33k

T V2A ng2 p2 k2 12AX7
R R18 x n2 220k
R R17 n2 p2 100k
C C13 n2 p2 500p
R R10 k2 0 2k7
C C20 k2 0 0.68u
C C14 p2 f2 2n2
C C15 p2 fat 22n
R SW_FAT fat f2 1e12
R R20 f2 s2a 560k
C C16 f2 s2a 680p
R SW_S2A s2a g2c 1
R R19 f2 s2b 68k
R SW_S2B s2b g2c 1e12
R R26 g2c r26 220k
R SW_S2C r26 0 1
R R16 g2c r16 68k
R SW_S2D r16 0 1e12
R R23 g2c ng3 33k

T V2B ng3 p3 kb 12AX7
R R21 x p3 100k
R R24 kb 0 2k7
C C17 kb 0 0.68u
C C19 p3 gt 2n2
R VR_GT gt gw 1
R VR_GB gw 0 1
R R30 gw ng4 470k
C C26 gw ng4 500p
R R28 ng4 0 470k
